    ["拿到这本秘籍的人，你太幸运了，我来帮助你把两把大剑都运送进村内，你就可回到你原来的世界。听我说，先从村外的湖内来到封存圣地，封存秩序大剑，把混乱大剑取出，再把它固定在我们的村门，可以松动卡住的水阀，把湖水从村外引到村内。这样即可绕过村门的检查，从村内再前往封存圣地，通过【某种方式】......可以取回封存的秩序大剑。再把它拿回来，斩断这秩序之网的能量源，即可集齐两把大剑。切记勿告诉其他人，我们即将沉睡，不希望被任何人打扰。"] = "Whoever gets this secret manual, you are so lucky. I will help you transport both greatswords into the village so you can return to your original world. Listen to me: first, come from the lake outside the village to the Sealed Holy Land, seal the Order Greatsword, take out the Chaos Greatsword, and then fix it at our village gate. This can loosen the jammed water valve and divert the lake water from outside the village into the village. This way, you can bypass the inspection at the village gate, go from inside the village to the Sealed Holy Land, and through [some method]... you can retrieve the sealed Order Greatsword. Then take it back and cut off the energy source of this Web of Order, and you will have collected both greatswords. Remember not to tell anyone else; we are about to fall into a deep sleep and do not wish to be disturbed by anyone.",
